{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13102270","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13102270","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1310227001:0":{"text":"二千年前、第一次神魔大戦で女神デューラ様がお守りくださったおかげで人間が勝利し、それ以来、人々は女神様を信仰するようになりました。","source_cn":"据说两千年前的第一次神魔战争中，女神艾雅庇佑了人类。最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3B909C0F315531","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1310227002:0":{"text":"戦争が終わった後、ある若い女性が氷の上でデューラ様に踊りを捧げ、女神様の庇護を授かったんです。","source_cn":"在战后，有位年轻女性在冰面上向艾雅献舞，获得了女神的喜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBCF497CF32734645","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1310227003:0":{"text":"そして、女神様が喜ばれたその氷の舞が、後に祭典のフラワースケートになったのですよ。","source_cn":"后来，这受女神艾雅喜爱的冰之舞，就慢慢演化成为了祭典上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74F2AEF920AC0DC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310227004:0":{"text":"さあ、滑りましょう！もしかしたら、あなたにも女神様の加護が舞い降りるかも！","source_cn":"来吧，来滑冰吧！说不定你也能得到女神的喜爱和庇佑呢！<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72674F2A79F7EC99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:祭典办事员":{"text":"祭典のスタッフ","source":"祭典办事员","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}